      "Language": "spa",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 23 year-old woman with sarcoidosis initiated her illness with painful nodules located in palms and soles. This is un unusual clinical finding. Sarcoidosis must be included in the differential diagnosis of painful palmoplantar nodules."},
